      "updated": 1790153742205,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ArrayBuffer says: \"Here is some raw memory.\"\n\nTypedArray says: \"I'll interpret this memory as these particular numeric\ntypes.\"\n\nNow just an example how raw 8 bytes of Arraybuffer works for different kind\nof typed array for :- \nunit8Array :- space for 8 elements\nunit16Array :- sapce for 4 elements\nunit32Array :- space for 2 elemetns",
      "fontSize": 36.399999999999956,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ArrayBuffer says: \"Here is some raw memory.\"\n\nTypedArray says: \"I'll interpret this memory as these particular numeric types.\"\n\nNow just an example how raw 8 bytes of Arraybuffer works for different kind of typed array for :- \nunit8Array :- space for 8 elements\nunit16Array :- sapce for 4 elements\nunit32Array :- space for 2 elemetns",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BT2rEnSONZCwRYMuEYMF_",
      "type": "text",
