      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "writable : - Can the value be changed?\nenumerable :- Should the property appear during things like: Object.keys(person); If: enumerable:\nfalse then it won't appear there.\nconfigurable :- Can the property's descriptor itself be changed or can the property be deleted?\nFor example, with: configurable: true you can generally delete it: delete person.name;",
      "fontSize": 36.399999999999956,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "writable : - Can the value be changed?\nenumerable :- Should the property appear during things like: Object.keys(person); If: enumerable: false then it won't appear there.\nconfigurable :- Can the property's descriptor itself be changed or can the property be deleted? For example, with: configurable: true you can generally delete it: delete person.name;",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_QBAaWoPbTOPuR214MPSB",
