      "text": "Object.create()\n\nThis creates a new object whose [[Prototype]] points to animal. which\nmeans it is refrence and if we chnage dog.sound = bark it will also get\nchange in the animal. now animal have its own [[Prototype]] which it\nget from Object.prototype (.toString() , .valueOf() and etc... )",
