      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now this This entire path is called the prototype chain.\n\nSuppose we do: console.log(dog.name); it first search in dog (found) that it return\nthe value\nNow we do console.log(dog.sound); it first search in dog (not found) then search\nin animal (found) and returned\nNow we do console.log(dog.toString) it first seach in dog then in animal then in\nanimals 's [[prototype]] (found) return it\nNow console.log(dog.xyz); it will not found this in anywhere in the chain so it will\nreaches null and JS return undefined.",
      "fontSize": 36.399999999999956,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now this This entire path is called the prototype chain.\n\nSuppose we do: console.log(dog.name); it first search in dog (found) that it return the value\nNow we do console.log(dog.sound); it first search in dog (not found) then search in animal (found) and returned\nNow we do console.log(dog.toString) it first seach in dog then in animal then in animals 's [[prototype]] (found) return it\nNow console.log(dog.xyz); it will not found this in anywhere in the chain so it will reaches null and JS return undefined.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WKZrxfMlHZGqv_mDJnosw",
      "type": "rectangle",
